        "x-request-examples-description-1": "通过租户id14181c1245cf4fd786824efe1e2b9388查询当前租户的补丁开启状态,用来加载入侵防御页面的虚拟补丁的开关状态。",
        "x-request-examples-url-1": "https://{Endpoint}/v1/14181c1245cf4fd786824efe1e2b9388/ips/switch?fw_instance_id=546af3f8-88e9-47f2-a205-2346d7090925&enterprise_project_id=default&object_id=cfebd347-b655-4b84-b938-3c54317599b2",
